# KSI-SVC-ASM: Azure Key Vault - Soft Delete and Purge Protection
# Azure 8.5: Ensure key vault is recoverable

META
    esp_id `ksi-svc-asn-az-keyvault-protection-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `azure`
    criticality `critical`

    title `KSI-SVC-ASM: Azure Key Vault - soft delete and purge protection`
    description `Validates that key vault has soft delete enabled and purge protection active, ensuring cryptographic keys and secrets cannot be permanently deleted without a retention period`
    author `security-team`
    tags `azure,keyvault,soft-delete,purge-protection,secrets`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-SVC-ASM,NIST:SC-12,NIST:SC-28(1)`
    control_objective `KSI-SVC-ASM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `cloud-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `3`
    recommendation `Enable soft delete and purge protection via az keyvault update --enable-soft-delete true --enable-purge-protection true`

    impl_KSI_SVC_ASM `Automated secret management protection is validated by confirming key vault soft delete is enabled (enableSoftDelete=true) and purge protection is active (enablePurgeProtection=true). Soft delete ensures deleted keys, secrets, and certificates are recoverable for the retention period (Azure default: 90 days when not explicitly set). Purge protection prevents permanent deletion during the retention window, even by privileged administrators. Together these controls prevent accidental or malicious destruction of cryptographic material.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT kv_demo
        name `kv-example-prod`
        resource_group `rg-example-eastus`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE st_vault_protected
        found boolean = true
        provisioning_state string = `Succeeded`
        enable_soft_delete boolean = true
        enable_purge_protection boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN az_key_vault
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF st_vault_protected
            OBJECT_REF kv_demo
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
